  const deps = new Set(stack.dependencies);
  return stack.tags.filter((t) => !deps.has(t)).slice(0, 8);
}
```

then assert it in `tests/packs-suggest.test.ts` (deps excluded, cap of 8, empty result for an undetectable stack).

